{"id":"663198","name":"自制辣白菜","author":"坏脾气莲莲","authorId":"9299934","desc":"","cover":"https://i8.meishichina.com/atta/recipe/2025/02/11/2025021117392446500085719299934.JPG?x-oss-process=style/p800","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"大白菜","amount":"半棵"}],"sub":[{"name":"红油辣椒粉","amount":"60g"},{"name":"苹果","amount":"半个"},{"name":"梨","amount":"半个"},{"name":"大蒜","amount":"30g"},{"name":"生姜","amount":"20g"},{"name":"糯米粉","amount":"1勺"},{"name":"水","amount":"5勺"},{"name":"盐","amount":"适量"},{"name":"鱼露","amount":"1勺"},{"name":"糖","amount":"2勺"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"洗干净的大白菜，每片叶子上都抹上盐，加入没过叶子的清水，上面压个重物，我压了一个装满水的碗，腌4小时。","img":"https://i8.meishichina.com/attachment/recipe/2025/02/11/2025021117392450297428839299934.JPG?x-oss-process=style/p320"},{"step":2,"desc":"准备好半个苹果，半个梨子，放盐水里面防止氧化，准备好大蒜和姜片备用。","img":"https://i8.meishichina.com/attachment/recipe/2025/02/11/2025021117392451537841069299934.JPG?x-oss-process=style/p320"},{"step":3,"desc":"我直接用了混合好的红油辣椒面，如果你没有，可以用一半粗辣椒面+一半细辣椒面，混合均匀即可。","img":"https://i8.meishichina.com/attachment/recipe/2025/02/11/2025021117392452157619049299934.JPG?x-oss-process=style/p320"},{"step":4,"desc":"用烧开的开水倒进辣椒粉中，拌匀一下成泥状即可，这样把辣椒粉烫熟。","img":"https://i8.meishichina.com/attachment/recipe/2025/02/11/2025021117392452900237429299934.JPG?x-oss-process=style/p320"},{"step":5,"desc":"锅里放1勺糯米粉和5勺水，开小火不停搅拌，让他变成糯米糊糊。","img":"https://i8.meishichina.com/attachment/recipe/2025/02/12/2025021217393545042466059299934.jpg?x-oss-process=style/p320"},{"step":6,"desc":"煮好的糯米糊糊的状态。","img":"https://i8.meishichina.com/attachment/recipe/2025/02/11/2025021117392454446172399299934.JPG?x-oss-process=style/p320"},{"step":7,"desc":"把糯米糊糊倒进辣椒粉中，搅拌均匀。","img":"https://i8.meishichina.com/attachment/recipe/2025/02/11/2025021117392454828204359299934.JPG?x-oss-process=style/p320"},{"step":8,"desc":"把大蒜，姜片，苹果和梨，放进料理机打成碎末。","img":"https://i8.meishichina.com/attachment/recipe/2025/02/11/2025021117392455167988919299934.JPG?x-oss-process=style/p320"},{"step":9,"desc":"打好的蒜蓉放进辣椒酱中。","img":"https://i8.meishichina.com/attachment/recipe/2025/02/11/2025021117392455816828119299934.JPG?x-oss-process=style/p320"},{"step":10,"desc":"加入盐，糖，鱼露，搅拌均匀，记得尝一下咸淡，按个人口味调整。","img":"https://i8.meishichina.com/attachment/recipe/2025/02/11/2025021117392456342091399299934.JPG?x-oss-process=style/p320"},{"step":11,"desc":"做好的辣白菜酱，用来腌白菜或者萝卜都可以。","img":"https://i8.meishichina.com/attachment/recipe/2025/02/11/2025021117392457291619859299934.JPG?x-oss-process=style/p320"},{"step":12,"desc":"把酱料均匀抹到每一片白菜叶上，一片一片堆放起来，半个大白菜，做了2罐辣白菜。","img":"https://i8.meishichina.com/attachment/recipe/2025/02/11/2025021117392457796831389299934.JPG?x-oss-process=style/p320"},{"step":13,"desc":"盖上盖子，进冰箱冷藏发酵4到5天，就能吃啦。","img":"https://i8.meishichina.com/attachment/recipe/2025/02/11/2025021117392458386748989299934.JPG?x-oss-process=style/p320"}],"tips":"辣椒粉的用量可以按照个人口味增加或减少。 \n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：料理机\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}